    "synopsis": {
        "native": "\u00c0 la mort de son fr\u00e8re jumeau, Willy, 50 ans, quitte pour la premi\u00e8re fois ses parents pour s\u2019installer dans le village voisin. \u201c\u00c0 Caudebec, j\u2019irai. Un appartement, j\u2019en aurai un. Des copains, j\u2019en aurai. Et j\u2019vous emmerde !\u201d. Inadapt\u00e9, Willy part trouver sa place dans un monde qu\u2019il ne conna\u00eet pas.",
        "english": "When his twin brother dies, 50-year-old Willy leaves his parents' home for the first time and moves to a neighboring village. \"To Caudebec I shall go. An apartment I will find. Buddies I will have. And to hell with you all!\" Maladjusted, Willy sets out to find his place in a world that he doesn't know."
